      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "31-A is now going to proceed to Point Gamma at Kashima Shrine.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600258_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "31-B, could you keep up the support?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600259_EAoi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Roger!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600261_IMinase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Looks like the operation is going smoothly.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600262_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yeah. Maybe we'll even have some time to take a breather?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600263_IMinase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "If you think it's needed, why not? Aoi looks like she's giving this her all, too. Maybe she should take a breather.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600265_SMinase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Things are going well, meow.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600266_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, hey! Sumomo, look at these cattails growing here! You wanna play with them?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600267_SMinase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Don't treat me like a cat! Meow!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600269_EAoi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh! There's another large enemy ahead of us!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600270_SMinase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "No worries. I'll turn it into cat food.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600271_IMinase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yeah. We've been training nonstop, there's no way we can't take that thing down.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_013600272_EAoi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes, let's go! The next destination is just up ahead!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
  ],
